    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44986" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐρύ̆-ᾰλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλως</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with wide threshing-floor, broad</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῶρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					1.62
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέφεα</span> dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.748
			</span></i> (Antip. Sid.):—in <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				4.409
			</span></i>, etc. (cj. in <i><span class="en">
				13.68
			</span></i>), also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐρυάλως</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωος</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εὐρύαλος:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ Ἀπόλλων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
